.Dd October 17, 2026
.Dt PATINA-LOCK 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm patina-lock
.Nd the Patina desktop's lock screen
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Nm
.Fl h | V
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
locks the session until your password is typed.
Every screen shows the time and date in the bar's skin; the one with the
keyboard also shows who is locked and a password box.
Typing shows only dots; Enter checks the password through PAM, and a wrong
one is cleared with
.Dq Wrong password
under the box.
.Pp
.Xr patina-compositor 1
runs it, as its
.Ic [lock] command ,
on Super+Escape and Ctrl+Super+Q, before the machine sleeps when
.Ic on_suspend
is set, so waking never shows the desktop, and when the screen turns off
for want of input when
.Ic on_screen_off
is set.
It needs a compositor with ext-session-lock.
.Pp
Once locked, the compositor draws and sends input only to the lock
screen.
If
.Nm
crashes, the session stays locked, and running it again takes over.
A compositor restarted after a crash under
.Xr patina-session 1
starts locked and runs it.
.Pp
The password is checked with the PAM service
.Pa patina-lock ,
which
.Ql make install
installs in
.Pa /etc/pam.d ; without it, PAM's
.Pa other
service is used.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , -help
Print a short usage message.
.It Fl V , -version
Print the version.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ev PATINA_SKIN
The skin to wear; otherwise the bar's config's.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /etc/pam.d/patina-lock
The PAM service the password is checked with.
.It Pa ~/.config/patina-bar/config.toml
Where the skin is read from.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr patina-compositor 1 ,
.Xr patina-desktop 7 ,
.Xr pam 8
